WEBVTT

01:07:33.916 --> 01:07:35.250
What's wrong, Sid?

01:07:35.334 --> 01:07:38.086
Don't you want to play with Sally?

01:07:39.213 --> 01:07:41.423
Nice work, fellows.
Good job.

01:07:41.507 --> 01:07:44.092
Comin' out of the ground, what a touch.
That was a stroke of genius.

01:07:44.176 --> 01:07:45.885
Woody.

01:07:47.346 --> 01:07:48.680
Thanks.

01:07:50.474 --> 01:07:52.267
Everybody say, "Bye, house!"

01:07:52.351 --> 01:07:54.644
-Woody! The van!
-Bye, house.

01:07:57.565 --> 01:07:59.232
We gotta run! Thanks, guys!
